{"4256520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isle of Titans", "steam_appid": 4256520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Titans are coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isle of Titans</strong> is an idle incremental tower defense game where you defend a growing kingdom against endless waves of massive Titans. Build your defenses, shape powerful synergies, and decide how far you dare to push each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress never stops: every defeat makes your kingdom stronger, unlocking new buildings, upgrades, maps, and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/2d20747520787d0ab5cdb6b254cd855e.avif?t=1785330819\" alt=\"Slay the Titan\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/8110b1da42ae4b4f03dcf683c37e08ed.poster.avif?t=1785330819\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/8110b1da42ae4b4f03dcf683c37e08ed.webm?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/8110b1da42ae4b4f03dcf683c37e08ed.mp4?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no trash mobs there, only giant Titans storming your Kingdom's gates, one at a time. Every kill matters and brings you closer to surviving the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/dd88046671c61f2928359a5aac4490ed.avif?t=1785330819\" alt=\"Grow Your Kingdom\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/c2e7623bcc31c3f3196a049d6750b358.poster.avif?t=1785330819\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/c2e7623bcc31c3f3196a049d6750b358.webm?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/c2e7623bcc31c3f3196a049d6750b358.mp4?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned resources to unlock new buildings and upgrade your defenses. Watch the numbers climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/d6230de8cae8defa87ed60666176d8bd.avif?t=1785330819\" alt=\"Forge Your Build\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/27ff13f5066aeadd70c5004545debb2d.avif?t=1785330819\" width=1387 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful relics and discover build-defining synergies. Burn, Freeze, Curse or  overpower Titans with raw force while controlling the battlefield to your advantage.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Titans are coming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isle of Titans</strong> is an idle incremental tower defense game where you defend a growing kingdom against endless waves of massive Titans. Build your defenses, shape powerful synergies, and decide how far you dare to push each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress never stops: every defeat makes your kingdom stronger, unlocking new buildings, upgrades, maps, and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/2d20747520787d0ab5cdb6b254cd855e.avif?t=1785330819\" alt=\"Slay the Titan\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/8110b1da42ae4b4f03dcf683c37e08ed.poster.avif?t=1785330819\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/8110b1da42ae4b4f03dcf683c37e08ed.webm?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/8110b1da42ae4b4f03dcf683c37e08ed.mp4?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no trash mobs there, only giant Titans storming your Kingdom's gates, one at a time. Every kill matters and brings you closer to surviving the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/dd88046671c61f2928359a5aac4490ed.avif?t=1785330819\" alt=\"Grow Your Kingdom\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/c2e7623bcc31c3f3196a049d6750b358.poster.avif?t=1785330819\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256520/extras/c2e7623bcc31c3f3196a049d6750b358.webm?t=1785330819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so